WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.950
Module 1 is split-brain DNS and
leaving Active Directory DNS.

2
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:08.842
For twenty years AD was quietly
the agency's DNS service,

3
00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:13.750
and the records it kept for itself
don't follow identities to the cloud.

4
00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:16.372
So leaving it is an
inventory problem first,

5
00:00:16.372 --> 00:00:19.700
finished before the first
domain controller retires.
